signet-contacts
===============

This crate is a Rust port of the consumer half of forgesworn/signet-contacts
(the TypeScript reference, MIT licence, copyright ForgeSworn). Where the port
and the reference's docs/WIRE.md disagree, WIRE.md wins.

The conformance vectors in src/vectors/ are byte-for-byte copies of the
vectors in forgesworn/signet-contacts, taken at upstream commit
fbb13cdeefb3e07421228ab3245b7e17e403ecab. They are byte-identical to the five
files of the same name in forgesworn/signet-contacts-conformance.

The port was first written in an earlier codebase by the same author (MIT
licence, below), at source commit bdd4fe877acf3a6f4ca3174d1ce79c6672935e2f,
and copied from there unchanged apart from header comments.

